# hair/adult/pigtails_hang: the two Pigtails below their ribbons: flared, then tapering over the shoulders; the near tail in side
# views. They swing out of phase (hair keys: one tail lags out while the other swings in) and lie flat under a lying head
# P2b wave 2, HAIR. On the adult head box (STYLE_P2 21). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role hair pigtails
layer hairFront
anchor head
keys hair
z 1

